This file is a placeholder. Department Leads must choose a license before the
end of the Build Cycle. See the "Licensing" section of the Build Cycle Handbook:
https://github.com/MIC-AIML-Build-Cycle-2026-27/build-cycle-handbook/blob/main/docs/github-guide.md#licensing

Until a license is added, the default copyright rules apply: the code is
publicly viewable, but nobody else is granted permission to use, copy, modify
or distribute it.

Recommended default, pending confirmation of university / club IP policy:
MIT License. Replace this entire file with the license text when decided.
